.1.custom_build\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Vulkan 1.4.303 - Forward+ - Using Device #2: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nI added to **ProjectSettings** `editor/script/search_in_file_extensions` the `gdshaderinc` extension to look for certain functions\nThen when i clicking in a line **Search Results** panel, it lead me to GdScript's text editor instead of Shader editor. Clicking again on the same search result duplicates the file in script's editor as an **[unsaved] (*)** file\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a **shared.igshaderinc** file with the following code\n```\nvoid do_something() {\n}\n```\n- Go to Project Settings, search for `editor/script/search_in_file_extensions` and add **gdshaderinc**\n- In the script editor go to **Search > Finc In Files** or use the Ctrl+Shift+F shortcut\n- Search for **do_something** and accept the dialog\n- in the **Search Result** panel click one result found in a **gdshaderinc**\n- File will open in the script's code editor, unlike if you click in a **gdshader** file\n- If you click again in the same result of the **Search Result** panel, a duplicate of the shaderinc will appear in the script editor instead of opening the same file again\n- Also, from now on, trying to open the gdshaderinc file from FyleSystem docker, opens it in the code editor instead of the shader editor, but seems to only happen under certain strange conditions, like only when shader editor is open\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/669b235f-f936-45a9-8346-8213a88c30b1\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nEmpty Project with beforementioned shader file","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"h